{"sessions":[{"session":0,"messages":["Hey there, just wanted to check in. Quick reminder - I go by Priya Johnson, by the way. Did I mention I'm a researcher at Databricks? Just relocated to Berlin recently. Speaking of which, my birthday's coming up on April 18. My sister Nadia Williams keeps asking when I'll visit. Oh, and remember to keep your answers short and concise - that's standing instructions from me, haha. By the way, I've been at Databricks since April 2024 now."],"conveyed":["s0f0","s0f1","s0f2","s0f3","s0f4","s0f5","s0f6"]},{"session":1,"messages":["Hey! Quick question - do you remember my coffee preferences? I used to be all about oat milk lattes, but now it's just straight espresso for me. Similar thing with music - went from techno to indie rock. Speaking of which, I'm pretty comfortable with TypeScript, Swift, and Python now. Been working on those a lot. On a completely different note, I've been getting into rock climbing lately. It's been quite the adventure. Photography's another hobby I've picked up too."],"conveyed":["s1f0","s1f1","s1f2","s1f3","s1f4","s1f5","s1f6"]},{"session":2,"messages":["Guess what? Remember how I was at Databricks? Well, I actually left there in May 2025. Ended up joining Google as a researcher that same month. Funny how things work out, right? But then, as of August 2026, I left Google too. These days, I'm over at Vercel. It's been quite the journey switching jobs like this!"],"conveyed":["s2f0","s2f1","s2f2","s2f3"]},{"session":3,"messages":["Quick update - I've moved again! Remember me talking about Berlin? Well, that's in the past now. I actually relocated to Seattle back in May 2025. The weather's quite different here, that's for sure. It's been an adjustment, but I'm getting used to it."],"conveyed":["s3f0"]},{"session":4,"messages":["Hey there, just wanted to give you a quick update on work stuff. My manager is Dana - she's pretty great. She manages the Platform team, which I'm actually on now. Fun fact - we're using TypeScript for most of our projects. It's been working out really well for us."],"conveyed":["s4f0","s4f1","s4f2","s4f3"]},{"session":5,"messages":["Quick work update - I just finished up Project Granite in May 2026. Before that, I was working on Project Atlas, which wrapped up in March. Right now, I'm focused on Project Beacon. It's keeping me busy, but I'm enjoying the challenge. The project timeline has been quite packed lately."],"conveyed":["s5f0","s5f1","s5f2"]},{"session":6,"messages":["Hey, just thinking back to some things I've done this year. On July 3, 2025, I actually organized a hackathon - it was quite an experience! More recently, on July 24, 2026, I published a blog post. It's been a productive couple of months, I must say."],"conveyed":["s6f0","s6f1"]},{"session":7,"messages":["You know, I've been quite active lately. Back on November 14, 2025, I actually spoke at a conference. That was quite an opportunity! Then, on January 15, 2026, I ran the marathon - quite the challenge! And remember how I mentioned liking techno before? Well, I've since switched to indie rock for my music taste. It's been quite the musical journey for me."],"conveyed":["s7f0","s7f1","s7f2"]}]}
